WEBVTT

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:31.259
And, you know, the way I think,
like many companies,

00:15:31.259 --> 00:15:34.429
the way we initially
probably sought to do that

00:15:34.471 --> 00:15:38.392
was more, you know, you're seeing
a problem and you're reacting

00:15:38.392 --> 00:15:41.269
by trying to provide
mental-health resources

00:15:41.311 --> 00:15:43.146
or support or time off.

00:15:43.188 --> 00:15:44.606
And, I think -- and empathy,

00:15:44.648 --> 00:15:45.774
just empathy.

00:15:45.816 --> 00:15:47.401
I think that's really important.

00:15:47.442 --> 00:15:49.987
And I always say,
to so many of our managers ...

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:51.405
just care.

00:15:51.405 --> 00:15:55.325
If we just care,
a lot of things get easier.

00:15:55.325 --> 00:15:57.536
You don’t have to design 
a hundred mechanisms

00:15:57.577 --> 00:16:00.789
if you just have the right people
in place who care.